WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:01.149
You know what a great training

00:00:01.149 --> 00:00:02.775
video looks like.

00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:04.609
Making one is the hard part:

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:06.583
the recording, the voiceover,

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:09.067
the edit, the captions.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.285
What if you could just describe it?

00:00:11.285 --> 00:00:12.272
In this course,

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:15.178
you'll set up Claude as your video studio.

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:16.823
Stock footage.

00:00:16.823 --> 00:00:18.890
A natural voiceover.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.399
Captions that read,

00:00:20.399 --> 00:00:23.278
and motion that looks designed.

00:00:23.278 --> 00:00:25.031
You'll see every frame before

00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:28.619
it renders, and change anything with a sentence.

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:30.813
Three videos, start to finish,

00:00:30.813 --> 00:00:32.589
on your own computer.

00:00:32.589 --> 00:00:34.845
Make videos with Claude.
